## Notes

-   **GEO accession** links point to the corresponding NCBI Gene
    Expression Omnibus accession page.
-   **GSMs** are GEO Sample records. A GSM count should not
    automatically be interpreted as a patient count; entries may
    represent tissue sections, regions of interest, slides, or
    validation samples.
-   **FOV** means field of view; **ROI** means region of interest;
    **PDAC** means pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma; **PanIN** means
    pancreatic intraepithelial neoplasia; **CAF** means
    cancer-associated fibroblast; **apCAF** means antigen-presenting
    cancer-associated fibroblast; **TME** means tumor microenvironment;
    **FFPE** means formalin-fixed, paraffin-embedded; **PDX** means
    patient-derived xenograft; **scRNA-seq** means single-cell RNA
    sequencing; **IMC** means imaging mass cytometry; **ECM** means
    extracellular matrix.
-   **Size\*** reflects the supplied dataset-size estimates and may
    refer to supplementary files rather than a single consolidated
    archive.
-   **†, ‡** The dagger markers are retained from the supplied table;
    their definitions were not provided.
-   Dataset interpretations and metadata above are transcribed and
    organized from the supplied information. Verify accession details
    and publication mappings against GEO and the associated papers
    before using this catalog as a formal citation source.
